---
import '../../../styles/colab/shared.css';
import '../../../styles/colab/offer-services.css';
---

<section class="service-section" id="offer-services">
  <div class="section-bg">
    <div class="bg-grid"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-header centered">
      <h2 class="service-title">How I Build</h2>
      <p class="service-desc">From brief to deployment — a short, predictable loop. Every step hand-checked, every deadline met</p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="workflow-number">01</div>
        <div class="workflow-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-title">Brief & Scope</h3>
        <p class="workflow-text">
          You share references, brand assets, and goals. I confirm the scope, deliverables, and price before we start — so everything is clear from day one.
        </p>
        <div class="workflow-tags">
          <span class="tag">Requirements</span>
          <span class="tag">References</span>
          <span class="tag">Fixed Scope</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="workflow-number">02</div>
        <div class="workflow-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
            <line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9" />
            <line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-title">Design & Code</h3>
        <p class="workflow-text">
          I design and code the page based on the agreed direction, creating the layout, styling, content, and components.
        </p>
        <div class="workflow-tags">
          <span class="tag">Modern Coding</span>
          <span class="tag">Responsive Layout</span>
          <span class="tag">Components</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="workflow-number">03</div>
        <div class="workflow-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-title">Refine Together</h3>
        <p class="workflow-text">
          You review the page through a staging link or preview URL and share your feedback. I refine it until everything feels right.
        </p>
        <div class="workflow-tags">
          <span class="tag">Staging Link</span>
          <span class="tag">Feedback</span>
          <span class="tag">Iterations</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="workflow-number">04</div>
        <div class="workflow-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
            <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-title">Ship & Support</h3>
        <p class="workflow-text">
          Production-ready frontend code, deployed and tested across devices. I can also handle deployments, server-side setup, and ongoing maintenance.
        </p>
        <div class="workflow-tags">
          <span class="tag">Frontend Deploy</span>
          <span class="tag">Server Setup</span>
          <span class="tag">Ongoing Support</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>